%% Tenant/auth flow. Explained in: docs/production-hardening.md
flowchart TD
    REQ[Request + Authorization: Bearer] --> JWT{valid JWT?<br/>rotatable secrets}
    JWT -->|yes| TID[tenant_id from claims]
    JWT -->|no| REQD{AEGIS_JWT_REQUIRED?}
    REQD -->|true| R401[401]
    REQD -->|false| HEUR{token starts with tenant_?}
    HEUR -->|no| R401
    HEUR -->|yes| TID
    TID --> BLOOM{tenant bloom filter}
    BLOOM -->|definitely absent| R404[404 - no DB query]
    BLOOM -->|maybe| DB[(get_tenant_by_id)]
    DB -->|found| OK[TenantId → handler<br/>every query binds tenant_id]
    DB -->|missing| R404
    MTLS[optional mTLS client cert] -.->|verified CN → agent| OK
